<title>UK: POLL - Reuters foreign exchange poll - July.</title>
<headline>POLL - Reuters foreign exchange poll - July.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar is expected to fall steadily against the mark and sterling over the next 12 months, according to a consensus of 31 banks and financial institutions from around the globe polled by Reuters on July 7 and 8.</p>
<p>The averages of the forecasts were as follows,</p>
<p>			   1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	 12-MTH</p>
<p>    STERLING/DOLLAR  1.6783     1.6611     1.6472	1.6340</p>
<p>    DOLLAR/MARK	1.7465     1.7441     1.7262	1.6924</p>
<p>    DOLLAR/YEN	 113.18     112.75     111.06	109.60</p>
<p>Using the dollar forecasts above, the cross rates calculate at:--</p>
<p>			    1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	12-MTH</p>
<p>    STERLING/MARK     2.9311     2.8971     2.8435     2.7654</p>
<p>    MARK/YEN	    64.81	64.65	64.34	64.76</p>
<p>At 1145 GMT, the dollar was trading at 1.7544/49 marks and 112.64/74 yen. Sterling/dollar was quoted at $1.6936/46, sterling/mark at 2.9722/31 and mark/yen at 64.19/22.</p>
<p>The minimum and maximum forecasts were as follows --</p>
<p>    DOLLAR/MARK	1-MTH	3-MTH	6-MTH	 12-MTH</p>
<p>    MINIMUM	    1.6900     1.6800     1.6000	1.5500</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	    1.8000     1.8200     1.9000	1.8900</p>
<p>DOLLAR/YEN</p>
<p>    MINIMUM	    107.80     105.50     103.50	 95.00</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	    117.50     122.00     120.00	130.00</p>
<p>STERLING/DOLLAR</p>
<p>    MINIMUM	    1.6300     1.5385     1.4689	1.5000</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM	    1.7200     1.7500     1.7200	1.7600</p>
<p>The dollar is expected on average to weaken over the next month to 1.7465 marks before continuing the trend to 1.7262 in six months time and further to 1.6924 in one year.</p>
<p>The highest the dollar is expected to be at in twelve months time is 1.8900 marks and the lowest predicted is 1.5500 marks.</p>
<p>Against the yen, the dollar is expected to firm during the next month to trade at 113.18, before loosing some ground again to trade at 112.75 in three months.</p>
<p>The U.S. unit is then expected to continue its slide to trade at 111.06 in six months before falling further to trade at 109.60 a year from now.</p>
<p>The lowest dollar/yen is expected to be traded at in twelve months is 95.00. The highest is 130.00 yen.</p>
<p>The poll showed sterling mapping a steady decline against the dollar.</p>
<p>Forecasters expect the pound to struggle to trade at 1.6783 in one month, continuing its decline to 1.6611 in three months f rom now. Cable is then expected to weaken even further to trade at $1.6342 in a year.</p>
<p>The lowest level sterling is expected to fall to during the next twelve months is $1.5000, the highest it is expected to climb to is $1.7600.</p>
<p>The rankings of the 31 forecasters polled by the accuracy of their one-month predictions will be published in the first week of August, just before the results of the next poll.</p>
